# Hopewell Hall

---

## Facility Features

- **Dining Capacity**: 260 guests seated for meals
- **Meeting Capacity**: 90 for conference or seminar-style setup
- **Projector & Screen**: Built-in projection system for presentations and media
- **A/V Equipment**: Simple sound system available
- **Climate**: Fully air conditioned and heated for year-round comfort

{% imageSection
   image="/images/facilities/hopewell-hall-dining.jpg"
   alt="Hopewell Hall dining room set up for a large group meal"
   overlayPosition="center"
   height="md" /%}

---

## Meals During Your Stay

Camp Otyokwah provides great tasting, nutritionally balanced meals to fuel you and your guests during your stay at camp. From cooking, to serving, to clean-up we've got it covered. So come in, relax, and fellowship with others while filling up on our delicious meals. But don't forget to leave room for dessert!

We don't believe in a "one-size fits all" method when it comes to food. We strive to keep you in mind when preparing a menu for your stay, and select meals accordingly (i.e. youth, adults, etc.).

All meals are served in the dining room in Hopewell Hall located centrally to our lodging options.

---

## Dietary Accommodations

We do our best to accommodate various dietary needs and food allergies.

---

